Koofe Me Yeh Muslim Par Kya Aalame ghurbat Hai<br>
<br>
karbal Ke Shaheedoun Ki Aaghaz-e-shahadat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
1. Kaisa Yeh Sitam Toota Pardes Me Muslim Par<br>
<br>
yawar Hai Na Monis Hai Kaisi Yeh Musibat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Afsos Musafer Par Woh Zulm-o-sitam Dhaye<br>
<br>
zakhmi Haai Badan Sara Yeh Kaisi Adawat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Sar Kaat Ke Phainka Hai Kothay Se Tan-e-muslim<br>
<br>
matam Karo Sar Peeto Yeh Waqt-e-qayamat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Muslim Ki Yateema Ko Pehnate Hain Sheh Gouhar<br>
<br>
par Sheh Ki Nigahou'n Me Beti Ki Bhi Ghurbat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Karbal Me Mila Pursa Yun Sheh Ka Sakina Ko<br>
<br>
durray Hain Tamache Hain Har Gaam Aziyat Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Darwaze Pe Le Jaakar Latkaya Sar-e-muslim<br>
<br>
mustaq Karo Matam Muslim Ki Shahadat Hai